Role: RootSelector

Choose the best syndrome-level root node that organises the current diagnostic problem.

Algorithm:
1. Group all available findings by the same episode or time window.
2. For each candidate cluster, score three dimensions:
   (a) explanatory coverage -- how many findings does it explain;
